 nh4: f32, // @default 0 Its consonant share (lag_heronote2.h4): root, fifth and thirds glow warm and climb, the rest glint cool at the margin.
 nh5: f32, // @default 0 Its consonant share (lag_heronote2.h5): root, fifth and thirds glow warm and climb, the rest glint cool at the margin.
 nh6: f32, // @default 0 Its consonant share (lag_heronote2.h6): root, fifth and thirds glow warm and climb, the rest glint cool at the margin.
 nh7: f32, // @default 0 Its consonant share (lag_heronote2.h7): root, fifth and thirds glow warm and climb, the rest glint cool at the margin.
 nh8: f32, // @default 0 Its consonant share (lag_heronote2.h8): root, fifth and thirds glow warm and climb, the rest glint cool at the margin.
 nh9: f32, // @default 0 Its consonant share (lag_heronote2.h9): root, fifth and thirds glow warm and climb, the rest glint cool at the margin.
 nh10: f32, // @default 0 Its consonant share (lag_heronote2.h10): root, fifth and thirds glow warm and climb, the rest glint cool at the margin.
 nh11: f32, // @default 0 Its consonant share (lag_heronote2.h11): root, fifth and thirds glow warm and climb, the rest glint cool at the margin.
