// pal: 0 deep blue>amethyst>peach, 1 teal>aqua>gold, 2 magenta>violet>cyan, 3 amber>rose>lilac (continuous, wraps at 4).
// t: 0 shadow tone, 0.5 body tone, 1 highlight tone.
